  m_text: "Scholars and Sage can rotate ring pairs instead of moving:\n\n\u2022 A:
    Rotates 12 positions (90\xB0)\n\u2022 B: Rotates 6 positions (90\xB0)\n\u2022
    C: Rotates 3 positions (90\xB0)\n\u2022 D: Rotates 1 position (90\xB0)\n\nClicking
    rotation counts as your entire turn.\nAll pieces on those rings rotate together."
