  m_text: "Movement: Diagonally any distance\n\nCapture: Can capture moving onto
    an opponent piece\n\nRestriction: Need Technician (T) to jump ring pairs\n\u2022
    At start: Only in Aa rings\n\u2022 T in Bb: Can access Aa + Bb\n\u2022 T in Cc:
    Can access Aa + Bb + Cc\n\u2022 T in D: Can access anywhere"
