  m_text: "The board consists of 4 concentric rings arranged in pairs:\n\n\u2022
    A (Outer Ring Pair) - 48 positions each\n\n\u2022 B (Middle Ring Pair) - 24 positions
    each  \n\n\u2022 C (Inner Ring Pair) - 12 positions each\n\n\u2022 D (Center
    Ring) - 4 positions\n  The scoring zone\n\nEach ring pair can be rotated during
    gameplay."
