  m_text: "\u2022 Rush Hand/Mind to center for points\n\u2022 Keep pawns close to
    the centre to score points \n\u2022 Advance Technician/Sage to unlock board\n\u2022
    Use rotations to create advantages\n\u2022 Protect your scoring pieces\n\u2022
    Use en passant to remove threats\n\u2022 Pawns, Scholars, and Wiseman work better
    together. Keep them paired to avoid capture.\n\u2022 Aligned pieces can form
    walls for the opponent"
